        "scripts/harness.py": "--selftest is 68s measured (rest of the hook is 9s); CI runs it every push",
        # 42s measured on this machine, 20s of it the hang case, and every reward case needs
        # a host that HAS process isolation -- on one that does not, isolate.run refuses by
        # design, so the full flag would go red in CI for the correct reason. The partial
